%N A178764 Ratio of the primitive part of Fibonacci(n) to the product of primitive prime factors of Fibonacci(n).
%C A178764 Except for a(6) and a(12), it can be shown that all terms are either 1 or prime. In the first 10^5 terms, only 151 are greater than 1.
